cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ePOV: eDNA Brazilian Plant Occurrence Validator"
abstract: >-
  ePOV builds a curated occurrence database for Brazilian plants
  (Angiosperms, Gymnosperms, Pteridophytes, Bryophytes) by combining
  Flora e Funga do Brasil, SpeciesLink and GBIF, applying multi-layer
  coordinate and record quality filters plus cross-source deduplication,
  and exposing a web interface for spatial queries.
